        "Id": "53ccf4c192f7479fb06d4d2e3d84c537",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE:  open the plan (or ALL = whole model).  Every door / window whose opening (width + clearance 1) touches a column in the same wall at the same height slides along its wall to the nearest free place - clear of columns, the other openings and the wall ends - not further than 2.  No room = not moved, listed as CHECK.  Works with any column family (B19 or your own).  RUN False = list the clashes only.  Run again = nothing moves once clean.",
